    Remove entwine JSON (#6785)
    
    Replace entwine code that handles JSON with Gson.
    Gson was chosen because it is a JSON library that we also use.
    
    This mostly affects the admin ui and external api endpoints, since
    entwine JSON was used there for responses.
    
    Not sure if this warrants a new external api version, since this
    *should* not result in functional changes. Will create a new version if
    someone wants me to.
    
    ### How to test this patch
    
    Ideally you have a piece of software that uses the external API so you
    can check if the software breaks.
    
